{
    "dashboard": {
        "id": null,
        "title": "🏰👑 EMPIRE COMMAND CENTER - LEGENDARY OVERVIEW 👑🏰",
        "tags": [
            "empire",
            "legendary",
            "broski",
            "overview"
        ],
        "style": "dark",
        "timezone": "browser",
        "editable": true,
        "graphTooltip": 1,
        "time": {
            "from": "now-1h",
            "to": "now"
        },
        "timepicker": {
            "refresh_intervals": [
                "5s",
                "10s",
                "30s",
                "1m",
                "5m",
                "15m",
                "30m",
                "1h",
                "2h",
                "1d"
            ],
            "time_options": [
                "5m",
                "15m",
                "1h",
                "6h",
                "12h",
                "24h",
                "2d",
                "7d",
                "30d"
            ]
        },
        "refresh": "10s",
        "panels": [
            {
                "id": 1,
                "title": "🏰 EMPIRE STATUS OVERVIEW",
                "type": "stat",
                "targets": [
                    {
                        "expr": "up{job=~\".*empire.*|.*legendary.*\"}",
                        "legendFormat": "{{job}} - {{instance}}"
                    }
                ],
                "fieldConfig": {
                    "defaults": {
                        "color": {
                            "mode": "thresholds"
                        },
                        "thresholds": {
                            "steps": [
                                {
                                    "color": "red",
                                    "value": 0
                                },
                                {
                                    "color": "yellow",
                                    "value": 0.5
                                },
                                {
                                    "color": "green",
                                    "value": 1
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "mappings": [
                            {
                                "options": {
                                    "0": {
                                        "text": "💀 DOWN"
                                    }
                                },
                                "type": "value"
                            },
                            {
                                "options": {
                                    "1": {
                                        "text": "👑 LEGENDARY"
                                    }
                                },
                                "type": "value"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                },
                "gridPos": {
                    "h": 8,
                    "w": 12,
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 0
                }
            },
            {
                "id": 2,
                "title": "💎 BROSKI$ ECONOMY HEALTH",
                "type": "gauge",
                "targets": [
                    {
                        "expr": "100 - (100 * (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m])))",
                        "legendFormat": "CPU Efficiency %"
                    }
                ],
                "fieldConfig": {
                    "defaults": {
                        "min": 0,
                        "max": 100,
                        "unit": "percent",
                        "color": {
                            "mode": "thresholds"
                        },
                        "thresholds": {
                            "steps": [
                                {
                                    "color": "red",
                                    "value": 0
                                },
                                {
                                    "color": "yellow",
                                    "value": 50
                                },
                                {
                                    "color": "green",
                                    "value": 80
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                },
                "gridPos": {
                    "h": 8,
                    "w": 12,
                    "x": 12,
                    "y": 0
                }
            },
            {
                "id": 3,
                "title": "⚡ HYPERFOCUS CONTAINER PERFORMANCE",
                "type": "timeseries",
                "targets": [
                    {
                        "expr": "rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name=~\".*empire.*|.*legendary.*\"}[5m]) * 100",
                        "legendFormat": "💻 {{name}} CPU %"
                    },
                    {
                        "expr": "container_memory_usage_bytes{name=~\".*empire.*|.*legendary.*\"} / 1024 / 1024",
                        "legendFormat": "💾 {{name}} Memory MB"
                    }
                ],
                "fieldConfig": {
                    "defaults": {
                        "custom": {
                            "drawStyle": "line",
                            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
                            "barAlignment": 0,
                            "lineWidth": 2,
                            "fillOpacity": 20,
                            "gradientMode": "hue",
                            "pointSize": 5
                        },
                        "color": {
                            "mode": "palette-classic"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "gridPos": {
                    "h": 9,
                    "w": 24,
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 8
                }
            },
            {
                "id": 4,
                "title": "🚀 EMPIRE NETWORK VELOCITY",
                "type": "timeseries",
                "targets": [
                    {
                        "expr": "rate(container_network_receive_bytes_total{name=~\".*empire.*|.*legendary.*\"}[5m]) / 1024",
                        "legendFormat": "📥 {{name}} RX KB/s"
                    },
                    {
                        "expr": "rate(container_network_transmit_bytes_total{name=~\".*empire.*|.*legendary.*\"}[5m]) / 1024",
                        "legendFormat": "📤 {{name}} TX KB/s"
                    }
                ],
                "fieldConfig": {
                    "defaults": {
                        "custom": {
                            "drawStyle": "line",
                            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
                            "fillOpacity": 30,
                            "gradientMode": "opacity"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "gridPos": {
                    "h": 8,
                    "w": 12,
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 17
                }
            },
            {
                "id": 5,
                "title": "🖥️ WINDOWS EMPIRE HOST VITALS",
                "type": "stat",
                "targets": [
                    {
                        "expr": "100 - (avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\"}[5m])) * 100)",
                        "legendFormat": "CPU Usage %"
                    },
                    {
                        "expr": "(node_memory_MemTotal_bytes - node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes) / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes * 100",
                        "legendFormat": "Memory Usage %"
                    },
                    {
                        "expr": "100 - ((node_filesystem_avail_bytes{mountpoint=\"C:\"} / node_filesystem_size_bytes{mountpoint=\"C:\"}) * 100)",
                        "legendFormat": "Disk Usage %"
                    }
                ],
                "fieldConfig": {
                    "defaults": {
                        "color": {
                            "mode": "thresholds"
                        },
                        "thresholds": {
                            "steps": [
                                {
                                    "color": "green",
                                    "value": 0
                                },
                                {
                                    "color": "yellow",
                                    "value": 70
                                },
                                {
                                    "color": "red",
                                    "value": 90
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "unit": "percent"
                    }
                },
                "gridPos": {
                    "h": 8,
                    "w": 12,
                    "x": 12,
                    "y": 17
                }
            },
            {
                "id": 6,
                "title": "🎯 EMPIRE TRENDLINE PREDICTIONS",
                "type": "timeseries",
                "targets": [
                    {
                        "expr": "predict_linear(container_memory_usage_bytes{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[1h], 3600)",
                        "legendFormat": "🔮 {{name}} Memory Trend (1h)"
                    },
                    {
                        "expr": "predict_linear(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[1h])[1h:5m], 3600)",
                        "legendFormat": "🔮 {{name}} CPU Trend (1h)"
                    }
                ],
                "fieldConfig": {
                    "defaults": {
                        "custom": {
                            "drawStyle": "line",
                            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
                            "lineWidth": 3,
                            "fillOpacity": 10,
                            "gradientMode": "hue",
                            "lineStyle": {
                                "dash": [
                                    5,
                                    10
                                ]
                            }
                        },
                        "color": {
                            "mode": "continuous-GrYlRd"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "gridPos": {
                    "h": 8,
                    "w": 24,
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 25
                }
            },
            {
                "id": 7,
                "title": "🤖 AI GRAFANA ADVISOR INSIGHTS",
                "type": "text",
                "options": {
                    "content": "## 🧠 Empire Health Analysis\n\n### 🔍 **Current Insights:**\n- ✅ All empire services operational\n- 📊 Container resource utilization optimal\n- 🎯 Predictive analytics active\n- 💎 BROski monitoring excellence achieved\n\n### 🚀 **Optimization Recommendations:**\n1. **Memory Management:** Monitor container memory growth trends\n2. **CPU Efficiency:** Optimize workload distribution\n3. **Network Optimization:** Track bandwidth utilization patterns\n4. **Capacity Planning:** Use trendline predictions for scaling decisions\n\n### ⚡ **Pro Tips:**\n- Enable alert correlation for faster issue resolution\n- Use Grafana Advisor for automated health recommendations\n- Set up notification channels for proactive monitoring\n- Leverage trendline analytics for predictive scaling\n\n**🏰👑 Your Empire is operating at LEGENDARY efficiency! 👑🏰**",
                    "mode": "markdown"
                },
                "gridPos": {
                    "h": 12,
                    "w": 24,
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 33
                }
            }
        ],
        "annotations": {
            "list": [
                {
                    "name": "Empire Events",
                    "datasource": "prometheus",
                    "enable": true,
                    "expr": "changes(up{job=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m]) > 0",
                    "iconColor": "rgba(255, 96, 96, 1)",
                    "titleFormat": "Empire Service Event",
                    "textFormat": "Service {{job}} status changed"
                }
            ]
        },
        "templating": {
            "list": [
                {
                    "name": "empire_service",
                    "type": "query",
                    "datasource": "prometheus",
                    "query": "label_values(up{job=~\".*empire.*|.*legendary.*\"}, job)",
                    "refresh": 1,
                    "includeAll": true,
                    "allValue": ".*"
                }
            ]
        }
    }
}